{"id":"bd7b31bc9c6fc9f2","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-positive-formula-stability.md","title":"正公式保证单调而非固定点稳定","display":"prop-positive-formula-stability — 正公式保证单调而非固定点稳定","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-positive-formula-stability","aliases":["91-prop-positive-formula-stability","91-prop-positive-stability"],"display":"prop-positive-formula-stability — 正公式保证单调而非固定点稳定","depends_on":["[[91-df-positive-formula]]","[[91-df-monotonicity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-positive-formula-stability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-positive-formula-stability</span><span>91-prop-positive-stability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-positive-formula-stability — 正公式保证单调而非固定点稳定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" href=\"?note=e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" title=\"91-df-positive-formula\">91-df-positive-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55157d609cf296e7\" href=\"?note=55157d609cf296e7\" title=\"91-df-monotonicity\">91-df-monotonicity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\n\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\n\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>\n(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 在句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中只正出现)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span>-结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\subseteq M\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\subseteq M\\)</span> (两个真理谓词外延)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_\\Gamma=(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathcal M_\\Gamma=(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_\\Delta=(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto\\Delta)\">\\(\\mathcal M_\\Delta=(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto\\Delta)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}formula\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_\\Gamma\\models\\varphi\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathcal M_\\Delta\\models\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}formula\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_\\Gamma\\models\\varphi\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathcal M_\\Delta\\models\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明对公式结构归纳：正位置的谓词外延扩大不会把已经成立的公式变假。\n这一性质用于证明由正条件定义的算子单调。</p>\n<p>单调性不等于固定点不变性。真理陈述者\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\">\\(\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是正的，却在不同\n一致固定点中可真、可假或为 gap。因此正公式不自动确定、也不自动满足\n跨所有固定点的全 T-schema。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-positive-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-positive-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"55157d609cf296e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-monotonicity]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\n\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_\\Gamma=(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_\\Delta=(\\mathcal M,T\\mapsto\\Delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}formula\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T(\\mathcal L_T)\n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\n\\land\n\\mathcal M_\\Gamma\\models\\varphi\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathcal M_\\Delta\\models\\varphi.","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1558,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","55157d609cf296e7"]}